{"id":"e010fb488b7602de","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-partial-image-preimage.md","title":"部分可计算映射的像与逆像仍可枚举","display":"thm-partial-image-preimage — 部分可计算映射的像与逆像仍可枚举","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-partial-image-preimage","aliases":["20-thm-partial-image-preimage"],"display":"thm-partial-image-preimage — 部分可计算映射的像与逆像仍可枚举","chapter":"2","section":"2.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 2.1.18","source_printed_pages":[27],"source_pdf_pages":[63],"depends_on":["[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-partial-function]]","[[20-thm-graph]]","[[20-thm-re-proj]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-partial-image-preimage"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-partial-image-preimage</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-partial-image-preimage — 部分可计算映射的像与逆像仍可枚举"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 2.1.18"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>63</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"15f8b03faeebed96\" href=\"?note=15f8b03faeebed96\" title=\"20-thm-graph\">20-thm-graph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"17d2f06d43a19f1e\" href=\"?note=17d2f06d43a19f1e\" title=\"20-thm-re-proj\">20-thm-re-proj</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal E\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal E\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\\in\\mathcal C_1\">\\(\\psi\\in\\mathcal C_1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi[A]=\\{y:\\exists x\\in A\\ \\psi(x)\\downarrow=y\\}\">\\(\\psi[A]=\\{y:\\exists x\\in A\\ \\psi(x)\\downarrow=y\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"15f8b03faeebed96\" href=\"?note=15f8b03faeebed96\" title=\"20-thm-graph\">20-thm-graph</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"17d2f06d43a19f1e\" href=\"?note=17d2f06d43a19f1e\" title=\"20-thm-re-proj\">20-thm-re-proj</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}partial\\text{-}image\\text{-}preimage}\\vdash\n\\psi[A]\\in\\mathcal E\\land\\{x:\\exists y\\in A\\ \\psi(x)\\downarrow=y\\}\\in\\mathcal E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}partial\\text{-}image\\text{-}preimage}\\vdash\n\\psi[A]\\in\\mathcal E\\land\\{x:\\exists y\\in A\\ \\psi(x)\\downarrow=y\\}\\in\\mathcal E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一集合的见证是 A 中出现的 x 及 ψ(x) 的停止历史；第二集合的见证是停止历史及其输出进入 A 的阶段。并行搜索给两个半判定程序。ψ 在部分输入上发散不妨碍此论证，也不能据此把逆像解释为全函数调用。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 2.1.18；印刷页 27；PDF 第 63 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-graph","status":"resolved","id":"15f8b03faeebed96","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-re-proj","status":"resolved","id":"17d2f06d43a19f1e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-re-proj]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]；see [[20-thm-graph]]；see [[20-thm-re-proj]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hy